## Moody Orange — Android Local Configuration Template
##
## NOTE ON sdk.dir:
## Do NOT hardcode or commit sdk.dir in this template.
## Android Studio automatically detects and configures the developer-specific SDK path
## in `local.properties` upon opening the project (e.g. C:\Users\<user>\AppData\Local\Android\Sdk on Windows
## or /Users/<user>/Library/Android/sdk on macOS).
##
## To configure local development properties:
## Copy this file to `apps/android/local.properties` and customize if needed:

# Backend API Endpoint (10.0.2.2 maps to host machine in standard Android Emulator)
API_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:4000/api/v1/

# Supabase Public Keys (Client-safe anon key; NEVER expose service role key)
SUPABASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:54321
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.example_anon_key

# Razorpay Public Merchant ID (Secret key is NEVER present in Android application)
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=rzp_test_exampleKeyId1234
